<description>&lt;p&gt;Communal clashes have intensified in Lakes state, prompting a curfew and a visit by caretaker governor Rin Tueny, while UNMISS has expanded civilian protection after deadly attacks in Rumbek. SPLA-IO forces retook Akobo following a dawn clash that left many dead and wounded, and SSPDF soldiers were wounded in an assault on a Mundri West military outpost. The U.S. Embassy condemned an assault on WFP workers in Jonglei that involved looting of aid, and an AIC cleric was shot dead in Juba. A Juba High Court sentenced five officers to 24 years for raiding a general's home. The lethal communal violence now far exceeds the 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPV3c5dVRRcDBQSkl3azc5Z2drTTFlMjFCYllTY3ZTY0JST3g0bjlVb2VKYkRzMHdwbkNuZXVDTUJ2ZkNCS1FBeERoMFh5UUo5cFBCdTMyWmVBQlE1Slp5M251SEhjV0hkbk9lMFdrSDFOMWlOY1pnQmFvaEJXaEExaTdmSjhLdVpRblp4YU5paWc0VzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOM0YtNEVQN1RvMDA3R2NJR3JtV2ZvVGpZR3dZWHhEdFpDS29rOTBXU1hhdWp1alVHSFJlcHpYNlhqOElJVTlGT0pwRE9jdndScEp5a1pwUDNmaXcwcnlYVWpxb1VKOFh1VFFpbFoxYnRsa3R5VkhVa1pwV0JDV1NYY0xvUmpCNU1nSWxQYkNMQTdCM2Q4Zm5qSjVmVXE?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPWXg0YWNCR3ROMHlpUU9ta2tzUUp6STZxSEhuSklPZTFiakRzRWpEZ2NGRXhRRGRIalBpT0JEb1ZjM0lDdkFKNWpyZGdEX3lzRktabHBud0hiMGVldHhKQktJUnplTlBNVl9tMnpSd21vdXk5bVNlazRELWZWTHprSmhzMnJmWnBMRnhvNGpTaW1EMXZuTExPYg?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.christiandaily.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNZ0l1NTJiOUtkUkIxSE52U1gzM0syMDBkamNBa2g2QmFhU3o2QzQxVUl0T3U1THpMUjNQUmpkV1ppNzlUUWo4eksyWnYtVVc0ZkEya0E2cE9jck1CakVZT29VUm9RRm13S0RYNDk1NU5UdTRHY1pUT0cxMl9ITy1OdmEzWlNpVmNvYmw2LQ?